name: boundary-move
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a verification trust boundary relocated — what a producer asserted
  is now re-derived by an independent oracle from a serialized artifact,
  or the reverse. The claim's content doesn't change; its justification
  source does. Distinct from widened (coverage catching up to an existing
  surface): this is the trust locus moving, e.g. evidence-follows-AST
  going from the pass's word to re-derivation from program.ast.json.
